  // lane publishes the identity. Each subgroup then folds all WG slots — lane
  // `sgLane` walks slots sgLane, sgLane + sgSize, ... — and one more collective
  // merges the lane partials, so every slot is added exactly once at any legal
  // width. The coordinates are the BUILTINS, never `subgroupExclusiveAdd(1u)` /
  // `subgroupAdd(1u)`: those agree with them under this contract, but a driver
  // in the wild answers a claim derived from them with zero. This entry point is
  // in uniform control flow (its only early return is workgroup-uniform), so
  // every lane is active and the full width is the right stride.
  var segTotal = total;
