// long, the window itself is the parallelism worth spending. Threads here stride
// the flattened tap index [kD x] kH x kW, each tap resolving its own padded,
// strided and dilated input coordinate, then combine the per-thread partials.
// With subgroups: a subgroup collective, then one shared-memory slot per
// invocation (the subgroup partial from its elected lane, the identity from
// every other lane) that every subgroup folds. Without subgroups, a full
// workgroup tree combines the per-thread partials.
