// Feature-independent high-contention ScatterND add for a one-element output.
// Each lane sums a grid-stride stream, each workgroup reduces locally, and one
// lane emits one f32 CAS. This replaces O(updates) globally serialized CAS
// operations with O(workgroups) CAS operations.
